<speak>I use the secure inbox when I am at home, then save documents that I expect to need again. Travelling is less orderly. I may read something on my phone between meetings and tell myself I will file it later. When I get back, I remember the conversation but not the subject line. That is why descriptive headings matter to me. A heading like 'Documents for your attention' could refer to almost anything. I would prefer a plain description of the subject, without my personal details displayed in the notification.</speak>